            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Fixed
- **Codex sessions with hooks installed show their full details again.** A
  Codex session that Perch hears about through its hooks lost the cost,
  context meter, effort level, task checklist and rate-limit warning that
  only Codex's own session file carries. Those rows now keep all of them.
]]></description>
